;
; Used by the routine at #R$9880.
;
; .
;
; A = room number (from #R$9880). HL = $D600 + room*32: a 32-byte back-tile
; index list per room (8x4 back-tiles, each 32x32px). For each of 4 rows x 8
; back-tile indices, looks up the back-tile's definition at $C600 + index*16 -
; a 4x4 arrangement of 8x8 "tile" indices - and copies it into the room's
; expanded tile-index map at $F800 (32x16 tiles, matching the 32x16-char
; screen). Back-tile index $10 is special-cased via #R$99F0. The table that
