 $ADC1 LD (IX+$01),A ;
 $ADC4 JP $AE84      ; => Reset room state=0 and hazard counter ($5C07)
*$ADC7 CALL $AE37    ; Creature Y-bound check via #R$AF09/table $AE9E, move up
